@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://cmt#Author> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Author> .

<http://cmt#AuthorNotReviewer> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Author_of_paper> .

<http://cmt#Co-author> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Author> .

<http://cmt#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceChair> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://cmt#ConferenceMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://cmt#Document> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Document> .

<http://cmt#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Paper> .

<http://cmt#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Person> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommittee> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommitteeChair> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee_member> .

<http://cmt#Review> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Review> .

<http://cmt#User> rdfs:subClassOf <http://sigkdd#Speaker> .

<http://cmt#addProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee_member> .

<http://cmt#date> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Date> .

<http://cmt#endReview> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Review> .

<http://cmt#hasAuthor> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Author> .

<http://cmt#hasProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee_member> .

<http://cmt#memberOfProgramCommittee> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee_member> .

<http://cmt#name> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Name> .

<http://cmt#paperID> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Paper> .

<http://cmt#submitPaper> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#submit> .

